\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Generative AI: Models, Architectures, and Enterprise Applications\par
\fs28 1. Introduction to Generative AI\b0\fs22\par
Generative Artificial Intelligence (Generative AI) is a branch of Artificial Intelligence that enables machines to create new content such as text, images, audio, video, and software code. Unlike traditional AI systems that focus on prediction, classification, and analysis, Generative AI learns patterns from large datasets and uses this knowledge to generate original outputs. Over the past few years, Generative AI has emerged as a transformative technology, helping organizations automate tasks, improve productivity, accelerate innovation, and enhance customer experiences.\par
\par
