\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs24 GPT (Generative Pre-trained Transformer)\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\fs22 GPT is a Large Language Model (LLM) designed to understand and generate natural language. It is based on the Transformer architecture and is trained on massive amounts of text data. GPT can perform tasks such as content creation, summarization, translation, question answering, and conversational interactions.\par
