\b\fs28 Conclusion\par
\b0\fs22 Generative AI represents one of the most significant advancements in modern technology. Models such as GPT, DALL\'b7E, Codex, and Stable Diffusion have demonstrated the ability to generate high-quality text, images, and code, while technologies such as Transformers, Diffusion Models, and GANs provide the foundation that makes these capabilities possible. Through applications in healthcare, finance, education, retail, manufacturing, human resources, customer service, and software development, Generative AI is driving innovation, improving efficiency, and reshaping the future of work.\par
